lemented and tested by seeding preserved-result-rejected events directly in the store, without waiting for CLI work. The CLI bead can append the same structured event without needing the worker consumer to exist yet. Together they preserve the parent non-scope items, ddx-074a82c2 failure context, and all verification requirements.\"}","created_at":"2026-07-29T02:12:54.661405263Z","kind":"triage-decomposed","source":"ddx work","summary":"decomposed into ddx-0c6d0d22, ddx-9a5525ae"}
